{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":2871078,"ns":0,"title":"Blast valve","extract":"A blast valve is used to protect a shelter, such as a fallout shelter or bunker, from the effects of sudden outside air pressure changes. A nuclear weapon creates a shock wave, which may produce sudden pressure changes of more than an atmosphere (about 1 bar) even several kilometres from the detonation point.","description":"Valve to protect against sudden air pressure changes","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}